WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.310 --> 00:00:06.959
If Hillary Clinton wins the presidency, if
she will be the first female president in

00:00:06.959 --> 00:00:17.099
America, what would you expect from her as
president?

00:00:17.099 --> 00:00:21.580
Well, in America, it's not the president - it's
an institution.

00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:26.880
So of course, she will make history as a woman.

00:00:26.900 --> 00:00:32.100
I wouldn't say that I am happy, but I hope
that she can really prove to be the woman

00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:41.300
that I think of - but I doubt that very much,
because again, she has to play the political

00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:44.820
game within the American institution, within
the American system.

00:00:44.820 --> 00:00:49.930
She has been playing it in the past and she
will be playing it in the future, but nevertheless,

00:00:49.930 --> 00:00:57.710
at least I'm sure I would like Mrs. Clinton
more than Mr. Trump in America.

00:00:57.710 --> 00:01:06.690
But for us, I'm hoping that she as a woman,
understanding that she is a powerful advocate

00:01:06.690 --> 00:01:12.850
of women in third-world countries and she
has been doing great work in that field.

00:01:12.850 --> 00:01:19.999
So I do hope that we can see a woman who can
have an impact on the global chaos that's

00:01:19.999 --> 00:01:26.600
going on now, today, and that she brings good
people and is surrounded by people that have

00:01:26.600 --> 00:01:33.580
an intelligent new vision about this world,
and that she [does what she promises].

00:01:33.580 --> 00:01:38.860
I was in America last week, in New York, and
to be very honest with you, the debate is

00:01:38.869 --> 00:01:41.100
very fierce against Mrs. Clinton.

00:01:41.100 --> 00:01:49.689
You know, Benghazi, she also has a lot of
history behind her.

00:01:49.689 --> 00:01:56.399
So I want to wait and see, because we were
happy with Mr. Obama when he came to power,

00:01:56.399 --> 00:02:00.009
but then he disappointed us, heavily disappointed
us.

00:02:00.009 --> 00:02:07.409
So I don't know if this politician, at this
age, being trapped in this political system

00:02:07.409 --> 00:02:12.900
that's bringing chaos to the globe, leading
us to more wars, to more blood...

00:02:12.900 --> 00:02:20.290
And I hope also to see that these international
institutions keep their promises and change

00:02:20.290 --> 00:02:23.370
these people and bring the youth to the forefront.

00:02:23.370 --> 00:02:28.700
I'm for the younger generation, only the younger
generation can bring the innovative ideas.

00:02:28.700 --> 00:02:31.730
It's fantastic what the youth is trying to
do in Libya.

00:02:31.730 --> 00:02:32.730
Fantastic.

00:02:32.730 --> 00:02:36.060
But who is giving them the chance, who is
listening to them?

00:02:36.060 --> 00:02:39.750
Or the women, who are all... away.

00:02:39.750 --> 00:02:46.530
Because we think, and if you think correctly,
of course, if you are a woman, if you think,

00:02:46.530 --> 00:02:50.099
if you are corageous, well, you have the wrong
recipe.

00:02:50.099 --> 00:02:52.190
They told me here at the EU!

00:02:52.190 --> 00:02:57.300
Many people don't want to meet me, I'm too
straightforward, I'm too much of an activist,

00:02:57.300 --> 00:03:00.430
I'm not a diplomat - no thank you, I don't
want to be a diplomat!

00:03:00.430 --> 00:03:04.250
What's a diplomat - to sit, listening to you,
insulting my people, insulting my country,

00:03:04.250 --> 00:03:05.909
and you want me to be quiet?

00:03:05.909 --> 00:03:06.909
No!

00:03:06.909 --> 00:03:10.340
I'm not interested in staying in Brussels,
staying in the EU.

00:03:10.340 --> 00:03:16.079
Of course, I will always be, hopefully, cooperating
with other departments for the benefit of

00:03:16.079 --> 00:03:18.360
my country within the EU.

00:03:18.360 --> 00:03:25.709
But if it's done wrong, I don't think that
I will be happy to...

00:03:25.709 --> 00:03:30.349
I've been within this international circle,
I've been very close within the UN community

00:03:30.349 --> 00:03:35.140
for 30 years, I know the corridors of this
UN system inside out.

00:03:35.140 --> 00:03:39.599
They have to change, there must be pressure
internationally.

00:03:39.599 --> 00:03:46.129
They have to know the game is over, they cannot
continue to contribute to this disaster in

00:03:46.129 --> 00:03:53.329
the globe, and the European and Western taxpayer,
they are the one who have the responsibility

00:03:53.329 --> 00:03:54.629
to question them.

